// data/spells_high.js — the 5th through 9th-level spell catalogue (D&D 2024 PHB rules).
// Pure data. Merged into SPELLS by data/spells.js; frozen on export.
//
// Every entry follows SPEC §3 exactly:
//   { id, name, level, school, desc, castTime, reactionTrigger?, range, ritual, concentration,
//     components:{v,s,m,consumed}, duration, target:{kind,count,radius,length,width,maxTargets,allowAllies},
//     attack, save, damage, heal, effects[], lists[], tags[], ai:{role,weight}, vfx:{style,color} }
//
// `range` is a NUMBER OF FEET, or the strings 'self' | 'touch' | 'sight' | 'unlimited'.
//
// `duration` stays inside the display vocabulary the UI knows how to render. Spells whose real
// duration is measured in days or years carry the true span on the effect's mech block as
// `days:` / `years:` and say so in the desc (e.g. Geas, Symbol, True Resurrection).
//
// Wizards of the Coast restored the old Realms-and-Oerth attributions in the 2024 PHB, so the
// named spells keep their owners: Bigby, Drawmij, Jallarzi Sallavarian of Waterdeep, Mordenkainen,
// Otiluke, Otto, Rary, Tasha, Tenser, and Yolande the Faerie Queen of Evermeet.

